    w('RF Power (p.1-22)', 'NOT STORED: RF power resolution (0.01 % of full scale; 0.01 dB), "LINEARITY (includes sensor non-linearity): RF range linearity +/- RF range-to-range change error" (a sum of two stored terms), response times (<10 s / <1 s / <100 ms), cal-factor table sizes and limits, displayed units, and the sensor-module ranges are used only as amp bands. The frequency band 100 kHz-2.6 GHz comes from the section introduction (11722A); other 8480-series sensors cover -70 dBm to +44 dBm and 100 kHz to 50 GHz (manual text, not tabulated).')
