    w('Tuned RF Level [Components]', 'Detector linearity is two limits per row (per dB of change, and a cap per 10 dB): stored as two specs on one row (periods "spec" and "spec, per 10 dB"; units dB/dB and dB/10dB). IF average detector limit is "(0 C to +35 C)". The IF range-to-range rows have no level band (IF range boundaries are only in the plot, p.1-23); the IF range is a qualifier.')
