    w('Reading the tables', 'Read from rendered images (110 dpi; 170 dpi crops of pp.1-20, 1-22, 1-25). The footnote superscripts on headings were read from the 110/170 dpi images; a few (e.g. which footnote applies to which sub-table) are small print: verify the footnote attachments (params notes) against the page before relying on them.')
